file tools/ales_segment_witness.rish the witness — builds, runs the selftest, asserts the GREEN line.
file active-designing/20260814-231217_fill-ales95-lotus-voice-activity-segmenter.md the self-approved design read naming the sequencing rule and the coverage/coalescing/crux invariants.
recommend keep-going — the next Lotus crux each build on ALES95 (a silence trimmer that drops the .silent runs, a voice-activity gate opening ALES65 on the voiced runs, or a crossing-rate-in-Hz once a real sample rate lands), each its own self-approved round; no custody gate reached.
